Package: pantheon-global-menu
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gala, wingpanel
Description: Global menu for Pantheon
 Shows the focused application's menus in Wingpanel, next to
 Applications. Consists of a Wingpanel indicator, which draws the menus,
 and a Gala plugin, which tracks the focused window, implements the
 com.canonical.AppMenu.Registrar service and types shortcuts on the
 indicator's behalf. Applications that export no menu get a menu of their
 keyboard shortcuts from the bundled mapping files.
 .
 Log out and back in after installing: Gala loads plugins only at startup.
